# metadata/.gitkeep
# =============================================================================
# This directory will store all UPLOAD METADATA files generated at pipeline start.
#
# Future files stored here:
#
#   upload-<upload_id>.json       — Upload metadata file per Terraform upload
#
# Each upload metadata file contains:
#   - upload_id:       Unique identifier (TF-UPLOAD-<UUID>)
#   - upload_time:     UTC timestamp of the upload
#   - uploaded_by:     User or system that triggered the upload
#   - terraform_dir:   Path to the uploaded Terraform directory
#   - file_hashes:     SHA256 hash of each .tf file (tamper detection)
#   - file_count:      Number of Terraform files in the upload
#   - metadata_hash:   SHA256 hash of the metadata JSON itself
#
# The upload metadata file is the ROOT ANCHOR of the forensic evidence chain.
# All subsequent pipeline stages reference this file via the upload_id.
# =============================================================================
